    "summary": "Knife and sheath, the knife with iron blade and wood handle; the sheath of carved reindeer bone and leather.  The knife handle with decorative metal (lead ?) mounts at each end, the blade stamped AEH. The sheath formed two pieces of bone with scalloped inner edges emphasised with incised line that echoes the scallops; the two pieces held together by an iron nail at the curved end and by the leather grip at the other end. The grip formed of one piece of leather sewn together with rope-like thread and decorated on one side with a reindeer, with leather thongs for attachment.",
